  {
   "id": "codex/tau_empire/rites_of_war/armoured_interdiction_cadre",
   "name": "Armoured Interdiction Cadre",
   "page": 28,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/armoured_interdiction_cadre/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "tau_empire"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 2 Hammerhead Gunship units.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Skyray Gunship unit.\n- Your army must include more Vehicle units than Infantry or Battlesuit units.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Hammerhead Gunships as Elite choices instead of Heavy Support.\n- You may field Piranhas as Troops choices instead of Fast Attack choices.\n- You may select a single Hammerhead Gunship in your army to be your Warlord. That unit may take a Warlord trait. It gains the Character special rule and +1 to its Ballistic Skill (BS), Attacks (A) and Leadership (LD) characteristics. If you do so, you do not require a HQ slot for your army.",
