   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- You may not include the following units in your Army:\n    - Ethereal.\n    - Aun'va.\n    - Aun'shi.\n    - XV95 Ghostkeel Suit.\n    - XV107 R'varna suit.\n    - XV109 Y'vahra suit\n    - KV128 Storm surge.\n    - KX139 Ta'unar Supremacy Armour.\n    - XV9 Hazard Suit.\n- Your army must include 2 units of XV8 Crisis Suit Teams.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field up to 2 units of XV8 Crisis Suit Teams as Troops choices instead of Elites Choices.\n- You gain access to Commander Farsight (see below).\n- Crisis Suit Commanders remove the Limited: 1 per detachment special rule from their profile.",
