  {
   "id": "codex/tau_empire/rites_of_war/hunter_cadre",
   "name": "Hunter Cadre",
   "page": 28,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/hunter_cadre/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "tau_empire"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 unit of Fire Warrior Team, 1 Crisis Suit Team, and 1 Pathfinder team.\n- For every 3 Fire Warrior Teams in your army, you must include at least 1 Cadre Fireblade unit.\n- You can only include 1 Auxiliary unit for every 3 other units in your army.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field 1 Crisis Suit Team without taking up a Force Organization Slot.\n- Night Fighting is always in effect even if your Battle Pack does not contain the Night Fighting special rule. You may select whether Dawn or Dusk is active. If both players would force night fighting. Roll off to determine which Night Fighting is active.\n- Pathfinder team units in your army gain the Hit & Run special rule.",
